{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2022-11-16 16:10:00', 'title': 'AMD ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT OF JOHN CALDWELL FROM BOARD OF DIRECTORS AND APPOINTMENT OF NORA DENZEL AS LEAD INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., NOV. 16, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AMD (NASDAQ: AMD) ANNOUNCED THAT JOHN CALDWELL IS RETIRING FROM THE AMD BOARD OF DIRECTORS AFTER 16 YEARS OF SERVICE. NORA DENZEL WILL SUCCEED CALDWELL AS LEAD INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY.'}